# Agent skills: `.agents/skills/` is the canonical root (read directly by Codex
# and other tools following the agents standard). Track only the repo's own
# `dora-*` skills; locally installed third-party skills stay ignored.
# A parent directory must not be excluded outright or git will not descend into it.
.agents/*
!.agents/skills/
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/dora-*/
!.agents/skills/FINDINGS.md

